+## Manual order entry (Issue #30)
+
+Both order pages offer **Neuer Auftrag** with multiple product rows, quantities, independent editable suggestions for business ID and PLC order number, and an editable serial start number. Serials increase across all rows within that order. Plant-local date/time is prefilled and sent without an offset. Customer number is optional; priority and parameters have editable defaults. All effective values are summarized before admission.
+
+`202` confirms durable admission, not PLC start. Uncertain attempts are retained in browser session storage and checked against the complete stored detail after reload. A reliable `404` permits an explicit retry of the identical request. Open details refresh independently of list filters and pagination.
+
